FLEET_EPIC_BACKSTOP_BUSY_CMD       seam: a fake "is the box busy" probe for the EPIC backstop
FLEET_EPIC_RUNNING_TTL             knob: how long the epic-running heartbeat stays fresh (2700 s, fleet-epic-heartbeat.sh / fleet_epic_running, #953)
FLEET_FOLD_POLL                    knob: internal pacing/limit, safe in-code default (fleet-repo.sh)
